@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@userId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_UUID_DO_USUARIO
@categoryId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_UUID_DA_CATEGORIA
@accountId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_UUID_DA_CONTA
@transactionId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_UUID_DA_TRANSACAO

### Saúde da aplicação
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 1. Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### 2. Criar categoria de despesa
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### 3. Criar conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta principal",
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "initialBalance": 1500.00,
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### 4. Criar despesa concluída
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compra no supermercado",
  "amount": 250.90,
  "date": "2026-09-03",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### 5. Conferir saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}

### 6. Listar transações por período
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?userId={{userId}}&startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 7. Cancelar e reverter transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compra cancelada",
  "amount": 250.90,
  "date": "2026-09-03",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "status": "CANCELLED",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
